<p>Your melee attacks also cause the target to bleed for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">25%, 48%, 66%, 81%, 95%</acronym> of the damage dealt over five turns.</p><p></p><p>Each point in Bloodstained talents reduces the amount of damage you take from bleed effects by 2%</p>